{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14391","headline":"送李司直归浙东幕兼寄鲍将军 · 朱长文","name":"送李司直归浙东幕兼寄鲍将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩书记早曾闻，二十年来愿见君。\n今日相逢悲白发，同时几许在青云。\n人从北固山边去，水到西陵渡口分。\n会作王门曳裾客，爲余前谢鲍将军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱长文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}